  #line-at(72.024pt, 579.55pt, "numerical aperture. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 606.43pt, "In summary, the above shows that using a finite numerical aperture objective to observe a signal that ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 625.51pt, "has broadband k-space contributions gives peaks in k-space, or back-focal-plane measurements, at the ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 644.47pt, "numerical aperture limit set by the objective lens when observing the signal away from its main peak. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 663.46pt, "We propose that this is the situation in our experiments i.e. SHG is produced at a wide range of angles ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 682.42pt, "from the gratings. When we observe a region away from the grating peak, the grating gives small ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 701.38pt, "contributions to the signal at angles close to the maximum observed value of k-space. The interference ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 720.34pt, "of this signal with the SPP induced SHG results in the oscillations observed in our measurement ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 739.3pt, "(following the schematic in Figure S7b). ")
]

// arXiv source page 31
#original-page(595.32pt, 841.92pt, none)[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(291.65pt, 803.976pt, "13 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 82.32pt, "To further support this conclusion we recorded a back-focal-plane signal from a region near an in-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 101.3pt, "coupling grating (i.e. spatially filtering to remove the signal from the grating region), without any ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 120.26pt, "reflection grating or other signal present. We again observe strong signal contributions at the maximum ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 139.22pt, "spatial extent of the back-focal-plane, as is presented in Figure S9c. This confirms our suggestion that ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 158.18pt, "the high angle signal is caused by the gratings rather than the SPP-induced SHG. ")
]

